{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/gquuslkgkrqlkz03v1xceklogkdg63o.mp3","text":"哈——欠。博士，我可以请会儿假，稍微离开一下吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/ati8psfy97y9883co19obcs1cni505e.mp3","text":"不用担心我的弓，每天我都有在好好保养。而且，它可比你要结实多了，用不着质疑它。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/1hl0psgcmawq4yzzl6809ftpcbn8zeq.mp3","text":"罗德岛确实有不少有趣的人，如果能找到一两个朋友当旅伴也挺不错的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/tbpr83y613vyn9yqykhkxbplt9qxljx.mp3","text":"现在的卡西米尔骑士，不是脑袋里都练出肌肉的傻瓜，就是沉迷广告牌烟火演出的小丑，啊啊，真~~无聊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:4/49/c44cwqxlfeofum2o01erx3zuh30rllx.mp3","text":"本来打算在完成手上的任务之后就回国的，嗯，现在我改变主意了。理由？哎呀，特意打听这种事，可是不懂少女心的表现哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6e/rq944w5s8099ua0s3vtvmobh8heui30.mp3","text":"想问白金这个称呼是怎么来的？这个嘛，卡西米尔的骑士杀手也有级别之分哦。虽然在我之上，还有玄铁三人和青金两人，但身在白金大位的，到我死去为止，有且只能有我一个人。所以，我就干脆拿这个作为代号使用啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fe/qb1vuzmfjldp22kgd0ie2bf4cfrwarw.mp3","text":"啊，是临光小姐！没有没有，我没打算对她出手。不如说，我更害怕她看到我就拔出战锤冲过来嘛。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d1/7k4q8oh6kv5cew8lri0cn6bq1v4zvvv.mp3","text":"卡西米尔还......真挺无聊的。唉~想到自己几乎快要被罗德岛的生活俘虏，我居然会有些生气呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/81/e1yv56ur9jortd29fyn2min6lxyyq75.mp3","text":"您有没有思考过，要如何维系罗德岛各位之间的关系呢？要知道，各个紧密连环间的空隙是结构中最为脆弱的部分；而利刃总会刺向铠甲的缝隙，一旦被趁虚而入，辛苦铸就的一切，顷刻间就会崩塌殆尽。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:2/26/bm2rxlw99etuador42aawz0ocn5n2ja.mp3","text":"真无聊~就不能发生些有意思的事吗~？","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/3t2kay3nyau6t1fpgvwbs2udmc00k6l.mp3","text":"卡西米尔无胄盟刺客，依约而来。怎么称呼？嗯......就叫我白金吧，请多关照咯。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/8010m3ygjgz7met05jw4b93ovpq6meg.mp3","text":"好啊，仿佛这张弓都变轻了呢，谢谢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/rxafi01757g3i93180w6enebfr0beu1.mp3","text":"晋升？白金位还不够可怕吗？哦~你真的，说了很有趣的话呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/gwys9p0w1nn0x28nhorqt2fkw5vb4ue.mp3","text":"呵......白金的真正面貌，你当真有胆量见识吗，我可爱的博士？","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:7/73/ser9tut4muuhedsurlte60ivwg5wisg.mp3","text":"白金，入列。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/6uc5qj1o5f37n014t53vsyglhuq79l8.mp3","text":"欸~？让我指挥？我可是没有指挥经验的哦？","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/2mdn21366iypjdm1p81hltze99l31xb.mp3","text":"接下来，会发生一场有趣的战斗吗~？","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:6/66/hxkq6qkmij8f16ehjcklky6xtegx86b.mp3","text":"一起攻过来也可以，反正你们都很弱。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/l04tkk1evrr0kv3566u7pyulse9wwnv.mp3","text":"请指示。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/kbpgohfjvocykmuml1gt99tdqb01wot.mp3","text":"目标是谁？","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:0/04/ql3uiih2uylnqjy1v771i5q62ovsmi9.mp3","text":"抹除开始。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/78/jffx95ecwl10muop679nj74la9bmw94.mp3","text":"迎战。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:5/59/slcsq6yyti1dsdasjy8ncs53ho9ss81.mp3","text":"数一，碎足。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/74/doho4u5ogx01f12ainxsi1xj6ntotry.mp3","text":"数二，破甲。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a3/h0f81xo43ddvlnzqdl5jxc64n78qhz4.mp3","text":"数三，贯身——","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/f1k4t7isbupr7mm9hkip4c6c6xi6b77.mp3","text":"——如此一来，便是将军喽！","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/dmwuuauy7fxybum4c9a1qfwqur2f3o0.mp3","text":"很好啊，已经让我十分享受了呢！","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/5e4zlyi8k205hg9nx18rmg3numm4spc.mp3","text":"将死。不好意思，是我的胜利呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/96/ejm0345gn7gya56vi504e0f3tbg4np0.mp3","text":"没能全部处决啊，很可惜。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/ti2b7i9uja1fqch2ge0t26gpd5qzqrp.mp3","text":"别放弃......坚持到最后的人才是胜者。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/nxyfuu2tksy9j3323rajj0bo80373c2.mp3","text":"这里的环境，感觉意外的不错嘛~","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/pa38jdcdgs3pzsdmvq8g110kyua4pqr.mp3","text":"唔嗯......","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d3/8eb5brtqzv7ss3l2blciefhy41kf94a.mp3","text":"要不要陪我去城市里走走？不方便的话，下次也可以。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/hsg7zjg0veru8q54hx88epeawxqpzl6.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:d/de/5vh8ec741n2olhh721l8sw3uao6s73s.mp3","text":"哦？没想到在这里碰到你了。我在这里干什么？吹吹风啊，下面太吵了，人又多，我想一个人待着。嗯？问完问题还不走，是想和我再多待一会儿吗？好无聊，不如我们偷偷跑掉吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:2/27/r8kinrciscg8yyl89w2anflpuhvq8oy.mp3","text":"气色不错呢，博士~","alt":"voice_cn/char_204_platnm/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/89/36pklvu9hd5v8dy1uokmfx87jyy2gu4.mp3","text":"哈——欠。博士，我可以请会儿假，稍微离开一下吗？","alt":"voice/char_204_platnm/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e1/0j9pgx3aubbn9x6xq6un5d2v7k6u03x.mp3","text":"不用担心我的弓，每天我都有在好好保养。而且，它可比你要结实多了，用不着质疑它。","alt":"voice/char_204_platnm/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/2sxkdoojn0c7lqp6qnbfe8qdsa2lsl9.mp3","text":"罗德岛确实有不少有趣的人，如果能找到一两个朋友当旅伴也挺不错的。","alt":"voice/char_204_platnm/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/dol13zfr25gu506r1wzdekzhyff8dkf.mp3","text":"现在的卡西米尔骑士，不是脑袋里都练出肌肉的傻瓜，就是沉迷广告牌烟火演出的小丑，啊啊，真~~无聊。","alt":"voice/char_204_platnm/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/5a9ty3qfvievoexzo2xu1hzthghp5kf.mp3","text":"本来打算在完成手上的任务之后就回国的，嗯，现在我改变主意了。理由？哎呀，特意打听这种事，可是不懂少女心的表现哦。","alt":"voice/char_204_platnm/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7e/1n2t2tpmfammsgp5l6ngsm5ziymftog.mp3","text":"想问白金这个称呼是怎么来的？这个嘛，卡西米尔的骑士杀手也有级别之分